{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["A Coffee Bean is a plantable seed that is also the ",["l","农作物","crop"]," harvested from the plants. Coffee Beans grow and mature 10 days after being planted (and every 2 days thereafter) in either ",["l","春季","Spring"]," or ",["l","夏季","Summer"],". The primary source of Coffee Beans is ",["l","灰尘精灵","Dust Sprite"],"s, but they are only rarely dropped (1% chance). They may also randomly appear in the ",["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"],"'s Special Stock for 2,500g (25% chance in Fall/Winter) or Standard Stock for 100–1,000g (during all seasons). Coffee Beans cannot be purchased from any other stores."]],["p",["When harvested, each plant gives four beans every two days, with a 2% chance for more beans. ",["l","初级肥料","Basic Fertilizer"]," and ",["l","高级肥料","Quality Fertilizer"]," affect only the first bean from every harvest."]],["p",["Because Coffee Bean is fundamentally considered to be a seed (rather than a vegetable or fruit), its sale price does not benefit from the ",["l","技能","Tiller"]," profession. Also, it cannot be placed into a ",["l","罐头瓶","Preserves Jar"],". However, 5 Coffee Beans can be placed inside a ",["l","小桶","Keg"]," to produce ",["l","咖啡","Coffee"],"."]]]],["Stages",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Stage 1"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 2"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 3"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 4"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 5"]},{"h":1,"v":["Harvest"]},{"h":1,"v":["After-Harvest"]}],[[["f","Coffee_Stage_1.png",48]],[["f","Coffee_Stage_2.png",48]],[["f","Coffee_Stage_3.png",48]],[["f","Coffee_Stage_4.png",48]],[["f","Coffee_Stage_5.png",48]],[["f","Coffee_Stage_6.png",48]],[["f","Coffee_Stage_7.png",48]]],[["1 Day"],["2 Days"],["2 Days"],["3 Days"],["2 Days"],["Total: 10 Days"],["Regrowth: 2 Days"]]]]]],["Crop Growth Calendar",2,[["t",[[{"b":[["t",[[{"c":7,"h":1,"v":["Base"]}],[{"h":1,"v":["Mon"]},{"h":1,"v":["Tue"]},{"h":1,"v":["Wed"]},{"h":1,"v":["Thu"]},{"h":1,"v":["Fri"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sat"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sun"]}],[[["f","Coffee_Stage_1.png",48]],[["f","Coffee_St